+        // Modems that run the ePDG tunnel themselves (MediaTek) report no IWLAN data
+        // registration to the framework, so an IMS voice route over Wi-Fi would be ignored
+        // (e.g. outgoing calls are rejected in airplane mode). Trust IMS in that case, and
